  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\quad$ Molarity $(\\mathrm{M})=\\frac{\\mathrm{wt} \\times 1000}{\\text { mol. wt. } \\times \\mathrm{vol}(\\mathrm{mL})}$\r\n\r\n$2=\\frac{\\mathrm{wt} .}{63} \\times \\frac{1000}{250}$\r\n\r\n$\\mathrm{wt}=\\frac{63}{2} \\mathrm{~g}$\r\n\r\nwt. of $70 \\%$ acid $=\\frac{100}{70} \\times 31.5=45 \\mathrm{~g}$",
